    "seo_title": "The Funniest World Cup Opening Ceremony Moments in History",
    "seo_description": "From Shakira's Waka Waka chaos to Russia's dancing robots and Diana Ross missing a penalty — the funniest, most cringe-worthy World Cup opening ceremony moments ever, ranked.",
    "og_image": "https://images.pexels.com/photos/6270263/pexels-photo-6270263.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1200&h=630&fit=crop&dpr=1",
